# ANSI slots are tuned for readability on this paper, not for syntax:
# 0 is ink (~9:1), 1-6 and 8 clear 4.5:1, 7 and 15 are surfaces. The vivid
# accents live in 9-14, which `bold-is-bright` picks up. Claude Code's
# light-ansi base resolves its UI colours through these.
# Vendored from ghostty's builtin so the ANSI slots can be corrected:
# the builtin sets slot 0 (black) to the paper colour, which makes
# `ansi:black` text invisible. A local file of the same name shadows it.

